  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the first plane is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Equation of the second plane is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Required line must lie in both planes and parallel to the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Equation of both planes is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So the equation of the required line is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>",
